        "# Dictionary comprehension\n",
        "\n",
        "A dictionary comprehension constructs a dictionary from an iterable using key and value expressions, optionally with filters: `{x: x*x for x in range(3)}`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-dictionary-comprehension)"
      ]
